---
layout: base.njk
title: "SEO Blog for Small Businesses | Bhawani Growth"
description: "Practical SEO tips and guides for small business owners, written by freelance SEO specialist Bhawani Shankar."
---
<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>SEO tips for small businesses</h1>
    <p class="lede">Practical, no-fluff posts — the kind of thing I'd actually tell a client, not generic listicles.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="blog-list">
      {% for post in collections.posts | reverse %}
      <article class="blog-card">
        {% if post.data.featured_image %}<img src="{{ post.data.featured_image }}" alt="">{% endif %}
        <div>
          <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
          <p class="blog-meta">{{ post.date | readableDate }} · {{ post.data.author }}</p>
          <p>{{ post.data.meta_description or post.data.description }}</p>
        </div>
      </article>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
